DJbench

The setlists under data/raw are model outputs, recorded verbatim. Track titles
and artist names are facts about existing recordings.

No audio is hosted, copied or redistributed by this project. Playback happens in
the official YouTube embedded player, and every video is checked for
status.embeddable and region restrictions before it enters the catalog.

Model names and the names of the labs that make them are used to identify what
was benchmarked. They belong to their respective owners, and their appearance
here is not sponsorship or endorsement.
